_time_series` supplies the price.\",\"properties\":{\"fuel_cost\":{\"description\":\"Fixed fuel cost per unit of fuel, or null when fuel_cost_time_series names a time-varying one. Exactly one of the two is set; producers and consumers enforce it.\",\"type\":[\"number\",\"null\"]},\"fuel_cost_time_series\":{\"description\":\"Store-minted id of the fuel-cost time series association, or null when fuel_cost carries a fixed value. Exactly one of the two is set.\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]},\"power_units\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/UnitSystem\"},\"startup_fuel_offtake\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/InputOutputCurve\",\"description\":\"Fuel consumed during startup, as a curve in the unit's fuel units.\"},\"value_curve\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/ValueCurve\"},\"variable_cost_type\":{\"const\":\"FUEL\",\"default\":\"FUEL\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"vom_cost\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/InputOutputCurve\"}},\"required\":[\"value_curve\",\"power_units\",\"vom_cost\",\"variable_cost_type\"],\"title\":\"FuelCurve\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"FunctionData\":{\"description\":\"Raw mathematical data defining a function `f(x)` — coefficients or point tables with no units or interpretation attached. `function_type` selects the shape: linear, quadratic, piecewise linear through (x, y) points, or piecewise constant between x endpoints. What `x` and `y` stand for is supplied by whatever wraps this, and the `TIME_SERIES_*` variants hold a reference to a stored series in place of the numbers.\",\"discriminator\":{\"mapping\":{\"LINEAR\":\"#/components/schemas/LinearFunctionData\",\"PIECEWISE_LINEAR\":\"#/components/schemas/PiecewiseLinearData\",\"PIECEWISE_STEP\":\"#/components/schemas/PiecewiseStepData\",\"QUADRATIC\":\"