l input value, or null.\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]},\"input_at_zero_association_id\":{\"description\":\"Store-minted id of the time series supplying the input at zero output, or null.\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]}},\"required\":[\"function_data\",\"curve_type\"],\"title\":\"TimeSeriesAverageRateCurve\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"TimeSeriesIncrementalCurve\":{\"description\":\"A time-series-backed incremental curve. The static counterpart is IncrementalCurve.\",\"properties\":{\"curve_type\":{\"const\":\"TIME_SERIES_INCREMENTAL\",\"default\":\"TIME_SERIES_INCREMENTAL\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"function_data\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/FunctionData\",\"description\":\"Only TIME_SERIES_LINEAR or TIME_SERIES_PIECEWISE_STEP is admissible here; all other FunctionData variants, static or time-series-backed, are rejected by the consuming constructor.\"},\"initial_input_association_id\":{\"description\":\"Store-minted id of the time series supplying the initial input value, or null.\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]},\"input_at_zero_association_id\":{\"description\":\"Store-minted id of the time series supplying the input at zero output, or null.\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]}},\"required\":[\"function_data\",\"curve_type\"],\"title\":\"TimeSeriesIncrementalCurve\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"TimeSeriesInputOutputCurve\":{\"description\":\"A time-series-backed input-output curve. The static counterpart is InputOutputCurve.\",\"properties\":{\"curve_type\":{\"const\":\"TIME_SERIES_INPUT_OUTPUT\",\"default\":\"TIME_SERIES_INPUT_OUTPUT\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"function_data\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/FunctionData\",\"description\":\"Only TIME_SERIES_LINEAR, TIME_SERIES_QUADRATIC, or TIME_SERIES_PIECEWISE_LINEAR is admissible here; the static variants and TIME_SERIES_PIECEWISE_STEP are invalid and rejected by the consuming constructor.\"},\"input_at_zero\":{\"description\":\"Optional explicit input value at zero output. A number here, unlike the incremental and average-rate variants, where it is a time series reference.\",\"type\":[\"number\",\"null\"]}},\"required\":[\"function_data\",\"curve_type\"],\"title\":\"TimeSeriesInputOutputCurve\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"TimeSeriesLinearFunctionData\":{\"description\":\"Time-series-backed variant of `LinearFunctionData`. In place of inline coefficients it carries `association_id`, referencing a stored series that supplies them at each step; use it when the coefficients change over time.\",\"properties\":{\"association_id\":{\"description\":\"Store-minted id of the time series association whose values supply this function data over time. Resolved against the accompanying time series store on read; minted by that store and meaningful only against it, never assigned by a document producer.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"function_type\":{\"const\":\"TIME_SERIES_LINEAR\",\"default\":\"TIME_SERIES_LINEAR\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"function_type\",\"association_id\"],\"title\":\"TimeSeriesLinearFunctionData\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"TimeSeriesPiecewiseLinearData\":{\"description\":\"Time-series-backed variant of `PiecewiseLinearData`. In place of an inline point table it carries `association_id`, referencing a stored series that supplies one at each step; use it when the points change over time.\",\"properties\":{\"association_id\":{\"description\":\"Store-minted id of the time series association whose values supply this function data over time. Resolved against the accompanying time series store on read; minted by that store and meaningful only against it, never assigned by a document producer.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"function_type\":{\"const\":\"TIME_SERIES_PIECEWISE_LINEAR\",\"default\":\"TIME_SERIES_PIECEWISE_LINEAR\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"function_type\",\"association_id\"],\"title\":\"TimeSeriesPiecewiseLinearData\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"TimeSeriesPiecewiseStepData\":{\"description\":\"Time-series-backed variant of `PiecewiseStepData`. In place of inline coordinate vectors it carries `association_id`, referencing a stored series that supplies them at each step; use it when the segments change over time.\",\"properties\":{\"association_id\":{\"description\":\"Store-minted id of the time series association whose values supply this function data over time. Resolved against the accompanying time series store on read; minted by that store and meaningful only against it, never assigned by a document producer.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"function_type\":{\"const\":\"TIME_SERIES_PIECEWISE_STEP\",\"default\":\"TIME_SERIES_PIECEWISE_STEP\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"function_type\",\"association_id\"],\"title\":\"TimeSeriesPiecewiseStepData\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"TimeSeriesQuadraticFunctionData\":{\"description\":\"Time-series-backed variant of `QuadraticFunctionData`. In place of inline coefficients it carries `association_id`, referencing a stored series that supplies them at each step; use it when the coefficients change over time.\",\"properties\":{\"association_id\":{\"description\":\"Store-minted id of the time series association whose values supply this function data over time. Resolved against the accompanying time series store on read; minted by that store and meaningful only against it, never assigned by a document producer.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"function_type\":{\"const\":\"TIME_SERIES_QUADRATIC\",\"default\":\"TIME_SERIES_QUADRATIC\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"function_type\",\"association_id\"],\"title\":\"TimeSeriesQuadraticFunctionData\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"TopologyMapping\":{\"\$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"description\":\"Supplemental attribute storing the mapping between a zone and the associated buses in the base system.\",\"properties\":{\"buses\":{\"description\":\"List of buses in the base system that are associated with a zone.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"ID for individual component.\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"id\"],\"title\":\"TopologyMapping\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"UnitSystem\":{\"description\":\"Unit basis a stored value is expressed in. COMPONENT_BASE: per-unit against a base the component records itself. NATURAL_UNITS: the quantity's own physical unit. No system-wide option: a value per-unitized against a shared base records that base on the component and rides as COMPONENT_BASE. Used in three scopes, each read against its own record rather than a document-wide table: a component's own `power_units` (against that component's `base_power`), a cost payload's own `power_units` (e.g. `CostCurve`, against the owning component's `base_power`), and a time series association's own `unit_system` (governing only that one series).\",\"enum\":[\"COMPONENT_BASE\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\"],\"title\":\"UnitSystem\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"ValueCurve\":{\"description\":\"A cost or fuel curve: function data plus a declaration of how to read its y axis. `INPUT_OUTPUT` reads y as the total `f(x)`, `INCREMENTAL` as the marginal rate `f'(x)`, and `AVERAGE_RATE` as the average `f(x)/x`; the three can express the same underlying function and are inter-convertible given `initial_input`. The `TIME_SERIES_*` variants are the time-varying equivalents. Which form to use follows the data source: bid stacks are incremental, total cost tables input-output, efficiency tables average rate.\",\"discriminator\":{\"mapping\":{\"AVERAGE_RATE\":\"#/components/schemas/AverageRateCurve\",\"INCREMENTAL\":\"#/components/schemas/IncrementalCurve\",\"INPUT_OUTPUT\":\"#/components/schemas/InputOutputCurve\",\"TIME_SERIES_AVERAGE_RATE\":\"#/components/schemas/TimeSeriesAverageRateCurve\",\"TIME_SERIES_INCREMENTAL\":\"#/components/schemas/TimeSeriesIncrementalCurve\",\"TIME_SERIES_INPUT_OUTPUT\":\"#/components/schemas/TimeSeriesInputOutputCurve\"},\"propertyName\":\"curve_type\"},\"oneOf\":[{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/InputOutputCurve\"},{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/IncrementalCurve\"},{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/AverageRateCurve\"},{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/TimeSeriesInputOutputCurve\"},{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/TimeSeriesIncrementalCurve\"},{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-4643c51d11717913e8d0.json#/components/schemas/TimeSeriesAverageRateCurve\"}],\"title\":\"ValueCurve\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"XY_Coords\":{\"description\":\"A single point, given as its `x` and `y` coordinates.\",\"properties\":{\"x\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"y\":{\"type\":\"number\"}},\"required\":[\"x\",\"y\"],\"title\":\"XY_Coords\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"Zone\":{\"\$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"description\":\"A unit of spatial aggregation for zonal capacity expansion models. Used to define locations for supply, demand, transport, and storage technologies and the relevant policy requirements.\",\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"description\":\"ID for individual component.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the component.\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"name\"],\"title\":\"Zone\",\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"info\":{\"description\":\"Power system investments models: Technologies, Financials, Requirements, Attributes, Regions, and Portfolio components\",\"title\":\"PowerInvestmentsOpenAPIModels\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},\"openapi\":\"3.1.0\",\"paths\":{}}"),
